测，男童存在颅骨骨折和颅内血肿，口腔区域有多处撕裂口，“最长达15厘米，骨头已经露出”，他判断该伤情“或为人为强力造成的撕裂”。 “多处撕裂，骨头露出”！医生举报3岁男童疑遭生父长期虐待，当地：其父已被采取强制措施"},"attached_info":"CkoIzvTP8eHByOd7EAMaCTExNDY1Nzg1NCCV6KbABjAAOJkCQBRyEzE4OTg3MDQzMzQzMTg5NTM0MzJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"56 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-8a5c3298b0cca407175d30741b25970a_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"21_1745550947.394675","card_id":"Q_650118780","target":{"id":650118780,"title":"你认为央视春晚历史上的最佳小品是哪个？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/650118780","type":"question","created":1711364238,"answer_count":202,"follower_count":515,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[3931,5326,19801,89136,3385434],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkAIzvTP8eHByOd7EAMaCTEwNjc0ODY4MiCOsYWwBjAAOIMEQBVyCTY1MDExODc4MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"54 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-093653b216ae95ff6d513e99674b427e_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"22_1745550947.395129","card_id":"Q_30032629","target":{"id":30032629,"title":"为什么希区柯克没有获得有分量的奖项？奥斯卡，戛纳之类的？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/30032629","type":"question","created":1430524066,"answer_count":34,"follower_count":177,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[68,2538,2805,12560],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"为啥希导没有获得有分量的奖项？奥斯卡，戛纳之类的？"},"attached_info":"Cj0IzvTP8eHByOd7EAMaBzQxOTU0ODggoqGQqgUwADixAUAWcggzMDAzMjYyOXgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"53 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"htt